<view class="page"><view class="title">本周饮食趋势</view><view class="subtitle">只做温和提醒，不给饮食打分</view><view class="card tip">💡 {{tip}}</view><view class="grid"><view class="card metric" wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="*this"><text>{{item[0]}}</text><view>{{item[1]}}</view><text>{{item[2]}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">本周构成</view><view class="bar-row"><text>外卖</text><view><view class="fill" style="width:{{now.rows.length?now.takeout/now.rows.length*100:0}}%"></view></view><text>{{now.takeout}}</text></view><view class="bar-row"><text>带饭</text><view><view class="fill" style="width:{{now.rows.length?now.home/now.rows.length*100:0}}%"></view></view><text>{{now.home}}</text></view><view class="bar-row"><text>堂食</text><view><view class="fill" style="width:{{now.rows.length?now.dine/now.rows.length*100:0}}%"></view></view><text>{{now.dine}}</text></view></view><view class="muted notice">健康标签和趋势仅用于生活记录，不构成医疗或营养建议。</view></view>
